WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.375
Change only the numbers in front until every kind of atom matches.

2
00:00:05.224 --> 00:00:09.749
Sodium and chlorine make sodium chloride. Count each kind of atom.

3
00:00:10.651 --> 00:00:14.376
There are two chlorine atoms on the left, but one on the right.

4
00:00:16.554 --> 00:00:21.379
Make two sodium chloride. Chlorine matches, but now sodium doesn't.

5
00:00:23.315 --> 00:00:28.115
Two sodium on the left too: balanced, with the same atoms on both sides.
